  ('PST-0288', 'Geography of Pakistan', 'Cities', 'easy', 'Markhor Prep original question. HEC Law Admission Test (LAT) Part I, Pakistan Studies. Checked against: Ian Talbot, Pakistan: A New History; Pakistan Studies (compulsory), PTB', 'The Pakistan Military Academy is at:', '["Risalpur", "Kakul, Abbottabad", "Rawalpindi", "Quetta"]', 1, 'The PMA at Kakul trains army officers.', '{"0": "Risalpur has the PAF Academy.", "2": "Rawalpindi has the GHQ.", "3": "Quetta has the Command and Staff College."}'),
